<title>RUSSIA: Rouble fixed at 3,337 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble fixed at 3,337 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was set at 3,337 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    June 18		 June 17</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,337		   3,333</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7 095  941 8520</p>
